cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article given as the preferred citation."
title: "CVIc: Coastal Vulnerability Index Compiler"
type: software
abstract: "A web application for coastal vulnerability assessment. It divides a shoreline into segments, takes a vulnerability class for each parameter of each segment, and computes the Coastal Vulnerability Index (CVI) or the Integrated Coastal Vulnerability Index (ICVI) in the browser."
authors:
